uses the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]complement\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] update \
rule, which removes the input pattern from the recalled output. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"159398b6-c199-48e1-af07-64e8b56dd5fd"],

